id: pm-todos-oyf7
title: "Daily release fails its own release:check: the release regenerates CHANGELOG.md without --include-empty"
description: "The release step Generate changelog and release notes rendered CHANGELOG.md without --include-empty, but changelog:check (run by release:check) renders with it. The release therefore dropped the empty tag sections the check expects, and every daily release since the pm-changelog 2026.11.6 bump failed at Run release checks with 'Changelog is out of date' (reproduced on 2026-11-10 run logs)."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: changelog,ci,release
created_at: "2026-11-10T16:07:17.560Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-11T12:42:03.653Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-11T12:42:03.648Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-10T18:39:03.000Z"
author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: "The release generates CHANGELOG.md with exactly the section-selection flags changelog:check verifies; A contract test fails when the two drift apart again, and fails on revert"
resolution: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-todos/pull/190 (merge ab5260f25762, head fb77b25c367f)"
expected_result: "The release generates CHANGELOG.md with exactly the section-selection flags changelog:check verifies; A contract test fails when the two drift apart again, and fails on revert"
actual_result: "Merged at 2026-11-10T18:39:03Z; required checks satisfied; successful head checks: CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Greptile Review, Hound, codeql, test (22.18.0), test (26)"
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-10T16:07:25.163Z",claude-orchestrator,"Fix: --include-empty added to the release's CHANGELOG.md generation, matching changelog:check. A new contract test in test/release-workflow.test.ts compares the flags. Revert proof: with the workflow change reverted the test fails, and with it the test passes. pm-todos: typecheck clean, full npm test 475 tests / 470 pass / 0 fail (5 existing skips); new contract test 1/0 with the fix, 0/1 without it."
  "2026-11-10T17:19:56.265Z",claude-orchestrator,"CodeRabbit PRRT_kwDOSZpews61zLjn: the contract test now also requires at least one real writer (a pm-changelog CHANGELOG.md invocation without --check). A paired --check alone would have satisfied the filter. Revert proof: making every writer line a --check fails the test (0/1); unchanged 1/0."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project
  test/release-workflow.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test test/release-workflow.test.ts,project,claude-orchestrator,"2026-11-10T16:07:23.279Z",local_mutation,fix/release-changelog-include-empty
